<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56759" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερά̄τ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρας</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small horn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.977a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
				<i>antennae</i> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάραβος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				526a7
			</span></i>; of the hermit-crab, ib.<i><span class="en">
				529a27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl.,
				<i>curved ends</i> of the womb (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.7
				</span></i>
			), ib.<i><span class="en">
				510b19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> musical
			instrument, perh. <i>fife</i> or <i>clarionet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				29.32
			</span></i>, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραμείου</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				26.1.4
			</span></i>, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				1a
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>carat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				1728
			</span></i>
			<i>of a pound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.775
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
			</span></i>
			<i>*Mens.</i><i><span class="en">
				60.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nou.</u>
				32.1
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>siliqua</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				521.27
			</span></i> (Abydos, <span class="entity">v/vi A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερατωνία</span>
			, Colum.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Arbor.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράτια</span>
			.</div>
